# Submodules are declared by live path only — and by the one-entry rule
# (docs/REPO_TOPOLOGY.md §Rules): only the github/gitignore entry is allowed.
#
# Nested checkouts (engines/herd/*, sigma, pi-skills, work/*, plugins/*, etc.)
# are independent repos coordinated by gitkb/meta — NOT gitlinks. They remain
# on disk as separate checkouts; the estate simply does not index them.
# Re-adding any gitlink here is a top-level defect to undo (see REPO_TOPOLOGY.md).
[submodule "ops/gitignore/templates"]
	path = ops/gitignore/templates
	url = https://github.com/github/gitignore.git